  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_037) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.706). This experiment tests replacing scvi_n200 with scgpt (a more complex RNA encoder) while keeping other components fixed, isolating the impact of the RNA representation. It balances exploitation (building on a strong baseline) and exploration (testing a novel encoder), and avoids changing multiple variables simultaneously."  
}

